==Translingual==

===Etymology===
All three parts have to do with ''[[goat]]'':
Greek ''tragos'' "male goat" (compare [[tragedy]];
Greep ''[[Pan]]'' (ancient god with goat feet);
Latin [[satyrus]] "[[Satyr]]"

===Noun===
